	(text "05 - Stack Interface\nJ8/J9 are 2x5 P2.00 and mate with the Motion board's J8/J9 (same Conn_02x05_Odd_Even symbol, pin N here is pin N there).\nOne processor: I2C (motor drivers, IMU) + MOT_INT on J8, the odometry SPI on J9, power both sides.\nBOOT and RESET act on the P4 (pull-ups on sheet 02 / in the module); the P4 drives the LED. VISION_EN is gone." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00006-0000-4000-8000-000000000089"))
